---
/**
 * Knowledge Hub page: “Knowledge Hub” section.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-4b18e2e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="4b18e2e"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-383bf16 vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
      data-id="383bf16"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="heading.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container"><h1 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">Knowledge Hub</h1></div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-1c24682 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
      data-id="1c24682"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container"><p class="p1"><i>Thinking that helps you decide better</i></p></div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-6992350 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
      data-id="6992350"
      data-element_type="widget"
      data-e-type="widget"
      data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
    >
      <div class="vb-widget-container">
        <p class="p1">
          The VentureBean Knowledge Hub brings together our perspectives, tools, and public work in one place. It is
          designed for founders, CXOs, and leadership teams dealing with real business decisions. The content focuses on
          clarity, judgment, and practical thinking. Everything here is shaped by advisory and leadership work across
          industries. The goal is to help leaders focus and move forward with intent and confidence.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
